<title>USA: Medicis to buy certain Syntex assets.</title>
<headline>Medicis to buy certain Syntex assets.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medicis Pharmaceutical Corp said it entered a definitive agreement to acquire certain dermatology assets of Roche Holding Ltd affiliate Syntex (U.S.A) Inc and its affiliated companies in a transaction that Medicis expects to be highly accretive to its earnings.</p>
<p>The being purchased include the prescription topical steroid brands LIDEX and SYNALAR, for which Medicis said it will pay Syntex up to $31 million.</p>
</text>
